---
function arrow(x1: number, y1: number, x2: number, y2: number) {
  const a = Math.atan2(y2 - y1, x2 - x1);
  const p1 = [x2 - 9 * Math.cos(a - 0.45), y2 - 9 * Math.sin(a - 0.45)];
  const p2 = [x2 - 9 * Math.cos(a + 0.45), y2 - 9 * Math.sin(a + 0.45)];
  return {
    line: `M ${x1} ${y1} L ${x2 - 6 * Math.cos(a)} ${y2 - 6 * Math.sin(a)}`,
    head: `${x2},${y2} ${p1[0].toFixed(1)},${p1[1].toFixed(1)} ${p2[0].toFixed(1)},${p2[1].toFixed(1)}`,
  };
}
const W = 900, H = 330;
---
<figure class="gp1c">
  <div class="gp1c-scroll">
  <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="example.com/greeter requires rsc.io/quote v1.5.2 directly. rsc.io/quote needs rsc.io/sampler v1.3.0 and golang.org/x/text, both marked indirect. go.sum holds a checksum per module version, and a changed checksum stops the build.">
    <text x="20" y="26" class="h"><tspan data-lang-en>Who needs whom</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Ai cần ai</tspan></text>
    <rect x="20" y="110" width="210" height="54" rx="6" class="box" />
    <text x="125" y="134" text-anchor="middle" class="t">example.com/greeter</text>
    <text x="125" y="153" text-anchor="middle" class="m"><tspan data-lang-en>your module</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>module của bạn</tspan></text>
    <rect x="320" y="110" width="200" height="54" rx="6" class="box" />
    <text x="420" y="134" text-anchor="middle" class="t">rsc.io/quote v1.5.2</text>
    <text x="420" y="153" text-anchor="middle" class="m"><tspan data-lang-en>you asked for it</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>bạn yêu cầu trực tiếp</tspan></text>
    <rect x="610" y="56" width="270" height="50" rx="6" class="box" stroke-dasharray="5 4" />
    <text x="745" y="79" text-anchor="middle" class="t">rsc.io/sampler v1.3.0</text>
    <text x="745" y="97" text-anchor="middle" class="m">// indirect</text>
    <rect x="610" y="168" width="270" height="50" rx="6" class="box" stroke-dasharray="5 4" />
    <text x="745" y="190" text-anchor="middle" class="t">golang.org/x/text v0.0.0-2017…</text>
    <text x="745" y="208" text-anchor="middle" class="m">// indirect</text>
    {(() => { const a = arrow(230, 137, 316, 137); return <g><path d={a.line} class="ln" /><polygon points={a.head} class="hd" /></g>; })()}
    {(() => { const a = arrow(520, 125, 606, 84); return <g><path d={a.line} class="lnd" /><polygon points={a.head} class="hd" /></g>; })()}
    {(() => { const a = arrow(520, 150, 606, 192); return <g><path d={a.line} class="lnd" /><polygon points={a.head} class="hd" /></g>; })()}
    <line x1="20" x2="880" y1="246" y2="246" class="axis" />
    <text x="20" y="274" class="t"><tspan data-lang-en>go.sum: one checksum line per module version, six lines here.</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>go.sum: mỗi phiên bản module một dòng checksum, ở đây có sáu dòng.</tspan></text>
    <text x="20" y="300" class="r"><tspan data-lang-en>One character changed in a checksum: verifying rsc.io/quote@v1.5.2: checksum mismatch</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Đổi một ký tự trong checksum: verifying rsc.io/quote@v1.5.2: checksum mismatch</tspan></text>
  </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>go.mod lists the modules; go.sum pins what each download must look like. Dashed boxes are modules you did not import yourself.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>go.mod liệt kê các module; go.sum ghi sẵn mỗi bản tải về phải trông thế nào. Hộp nét đứt là module bạn không tự import.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .gp1c { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .gp1c-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .gp1c svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
  .gp1c text { font-size: 14px; fill: var(--text-body); }
  .gp1c .t { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .gp1c .h { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .gp1c .m { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .gp1c .r { fill: var(--red); font-weight: 700; }
  .gp1c .box { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .gp1c .grp { fill: none; stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.5; }
  .gp1c .bad { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.2; stroke-dasharray: 4 3; }
  .gp1c .ln { stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.5; fill: none; }
  .gp1c .lnd { stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.5; fill: none; stroke-dasharray: 4 4; }
  .gp1c .lnr { stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.5; fill: none; stroke-dasharray: 5 4; }
  .gp1c .hd { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .gp1c .hdr { fill: var(--red); }
  .gp1c .axis { stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.5; }
  .gp1c figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
